cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.20669797
title: "AFSD Predictor: peak-temperature and processing-map calculator for Additive Friction Stir Deposition"
abstract: >-
  A desktop application that computes the peak contact temperature of the
  Additive Friction Stir Deposition (AFSD) process and builds 2D/3D processing
  maps with stability windows, using a force-controlled self-consistent thermal
  model for shoulderless and shouldered (MELD) configurations.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Dvirnyk
    given-names: Yaroslav
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5439-5413"
    email: dvirnyk@gmail.com
    affiliation: "Zaporizhzhia Polytechnic National University, Department of Aircraft Engine Technology"
keywords:
  - additive friction stir deposition
  - AFSD
  - MELD
  - peak temperature
  - processing map
  - solid-state additive manufacturing
license: MIT
version: "1.1.0"
date-released: "2026-08-17"
# Only the concept DOI is listed here. A version DOI must never be carried
# over from a previous release: tools read the YAML, not the comments, and
# would pair this version with the wrong record. After publishing v1.1.0 on
# Zenodo, add the version DOI it mints:
#
#   - type: doi
#     value: <version DOI for v1.1.0>
#     description: "Version DOI (v1.1.0)"
#
# The concept DOI below is shared by all versions and stays as is.
identifiers:
  - type: doi
    value: 10.5281/zenodo.20669797
    description: "Concept DOI (all versions)"
